++/* Called under fLock, only after a usable first layer has been validated.
++ * Releasing the console stops subsequent characters; it does not erase old
++ * glyphs outside the first layer's dirty rectangle. Clear the full panel once
++ * after the console has stopped, before any UI pixels are written. The normal
++ * console path still records ramoops before checking disableConsoleOutput. */
